-compileとpip-syncあたりをやるべき？","ts":"1636171664.298600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yHo+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"756f71ea-0020-473c-9808-59e3b526385d","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"おお。なるほど。requirements.txt にバージョン指定しててそれが入らんのは謎い。","ts":"1636171639.297900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eb9eJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8194f5c2-ab58-4960-bcc5-d9320c4d5fac","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"上限に上げて大丈夫かな…","ts":"1636171604.297200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"40Vd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31bbc7a5-2e70-4da1-8424-d1c363106355","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CK2REVD8E/p1636166916289100\u003e\n上限ではないんですが、1.16.2 を指定してるんですよね…","ts":"1636171587.296800","attachments":[{"fallback":"[November 5th, 2021 7:48 PM] raa0121: ちなみに、アプリ側の requirements.txt で、 numpy==1.16.2 を書いてるんですよね…","id":1,"author_id":"U06ECBRTJ","author_name":"raa0121","author_subname":"raa0121","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U06ECBRTJ","author_icon":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/35b032d7b2d4182b0c2de1ef85ba91f2.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0012-48.png","text":"ちなみに、アプリ側の requirements.txt で、 numpy==1.16.2 を書いてるんですよね…","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #lang-python","ts":1636166916.289100,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CK2REVD8E/p1636166916289100","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CK2REVD8E/p1636166916289100"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mUkwR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e3fff8a-dd88-4c05-8ded-aff75e0f8070","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"なるほど。アプリの requirements.txt で 3.6 が使える上限多分 1.19.0 を指定するのが良さそうですね。","ts":"163