b52c156bb6c","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"挙動としては、numpy が入る前に、pysptk が入ろうとしてるようなんですよね","ts":"1636169937.291200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/sLuT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69f1e3bd-3631-48d7-89aa-2209c51083a8","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"requirements.txt でバージョンを一意に指定しているのにそれが入らない…？","ts":"1636169038.290900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pcVc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5cb2cf4-e997-4ec5-b142-f4ad3da861bb","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"どうなのそれ？って感じなんですが","ts":"1636167555.290500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"unYz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7d2e0b3-d24c-4e47-9011-8504cfbf7bd8","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"requirements.txt で install する前に、 `pip install numpy==1.16.2` と通りそうでした…","ts":"1636167532.290200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"umeE5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89862d3d-f429-453a-ac07-dbaa279cb4fa","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なんかあるかな","ts":"1636167385.289600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cI2cc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f394aad-bd09-4a2c-b036-c438dba6ea6e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"ちなみに、アプリ側の requirements.txt で、 numpy==1.16.2 を書いてるんですよね…","ts":"1636166916.289100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=qQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c2cb8f0-5e3e-4ba9-8102-b96981c1200c","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/r9y9/pysptk\u003e を使ってるアプリを動かしたいんですが、\npysptk が `numpy \u0026gt;= 1.8.0` としてるせいで、numpy の最新版を使おうとしてます。\npython3.6縛りなので、python3.7 以上を要求されて、インストールが成功しない状態になってます。\nなんかいい方法無いでしょうか","ts":"1636166483.288300","att